WEBVTT

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:08.690
Hey, Ichinomiya, do you
want to come to my mansion?

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.110
Can I?

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.740
Of course.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.280
Even if you're just a provisional member,

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.620
you're still a member of the going-home club.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.410
Come, let us live under one roof.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.580
Oh, Seisa!

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.670
Yuriko?!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.320
Joining for a trial period doesn't
change anything after all, huh?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.160
That's not true, ryui.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:21.450
You have an extra minute of shower time,

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:25.000
and look—you have one more side dish, ryui.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.920
All right! Even if the extra dish
is just fermented soy beans,

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:33.630
if I think of it as a lavish and
elegant breakfast at the mansion...

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.180
An expensive full-course French meal!

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:40.050
I'll start with foie gras with caviar on top!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:47.020
Yum! Foie gras is delicious!

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.810
That seems heavy for breakfast, ryui...

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.610
But you can't fill your stomach with delusions...

00:02:55.820 --> 00:03:00.870
Now, I'm sure those of you who came
from our middle school already know this,

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:05.410
but I will explain about the club battles once more.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.410
Um...

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:13.170
The real eejit over there—I mean,
Eruna Ichinomiya—come to the front.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.710
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.220
A new type of banana!

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:22.600
No, they're crystals used in the club battles.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.930
Whoever breaks the three crystals
floating around their opponent first

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.850
within the allotted time is the winner.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:34.360
You can crush them with your hands like this—

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.990
Bite them—

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:45.330
Or you can release your own individual powers
and hit them with your special attacks.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.250
Special attacks?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.670
Sorry to keep you waiting, Eruna!

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.170
I'm finally here!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:58.840
After thorough preparation, here's the
magnificent entrance you've been waiting for!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.010
It's Shigure Ninomiya from the manga club!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.180
You know him, Ichinomiya?

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:05.470
He's just a perverted coz-con.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:06.680
Coz-con?

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.390
Like someone with a sister complex,
but the cousin version.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:12.020
Then, I, a coz-con,
will show you my special attack!

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.270
I call it, Hero Time!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.270
Huh?

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.900
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.900
Shoot!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.910
I forgot my pen in my clubroom!

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:30.750
In order to release your powers,
you need a summoning object, ryui.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:35.210
In the case of Shigure from the manga
research club, that item is a pen, ryui.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:38.960
I don't really get it, but does
that mean I have power like that, too?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.930
Unfortunately, power like that
does not live in you right now, ryui.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.760
However, since you enrolled in Mikagura Academy—

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:51.270
I've got it! I just need to get
Seisa to teach me all that stuff.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:54.520
I mean, it's after school! And she's my senior!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.150
And it's time for club activities!

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:59.030
- Seisa...!
- Ah... Wait a minute, ryui!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.490
Seisa, I've come to do club activities!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.080
Do you know what the going-home club does?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.450
Nope! So please tell me!
Please lead me by the hand!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.420
You can hold places other than my hand, too!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.540
All right. First, turn around.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.500
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.250
Next, put your right foot in front.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.210
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.220
Then, put your left foot in front.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.300
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.340
Repeat that about 350 times.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.310
Yes, ma'a—Hey, wait a minute!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.480
The going-home club's
club activity is going home, ryui.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.440
So long, then.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.400
No...!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.820
So, Himi, please lead me
by the hand and teach me!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:46.910
I'm not sure what's going on, but are you
saying that I'm Seisa's replacement?

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:48.330
That's not how it is!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.700
If I had to give an example, I'd say it's
like having a different stomach for dessert!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.960
Dessert? Then I want a strawberry mille-feuille!

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:57.830
Uh... that's not what I meant either.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.460
Look, you know how the type
of person you'd want to marry

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:01.710
is different from the type you want to date?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.670
It's getting harder
and harder to understand, ryui...

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.630
I'm not a wife or a girlfriend, you know.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:11.140
But I'm the type who saves the strawberry
on top of the mille-feuille for last, I think.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.720
Me too, me too!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.560
Then Eruna, let's save our
special attacks for that special day

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.810
and not show each other until then.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.900
That special... day...

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.780
What are you thinking about, ryui?

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.990
If you want to learn about the
club battles and special attacks,

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.830
you should go visit other clubs.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:38.210
The art club shows up
regularly in the top ten, ryui.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:42.250
Wasn't that kinda scary
upperclassman from the art club?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.630
Don't worry, ryui.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:48.300
Kuzuryu might look like that,
but he's kind at heart and a good guy, ryui.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:50.850
Excuse me!

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:54.890
The last great new student,
Eruna Ichinomiya, is here!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.650
Huh?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.570
Uh, um...

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.400
Uh...

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:16.500
He's kind at heart and a good guy,
but he's usually like <i>that</i>, ryui.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.000
That's no good, then...

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:20.580
Excuse me!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.550
The last great new student,
Eruna Ichinomiya, is here!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:31.850
Oh my! This must be of the
Dokugan school of flower arrangement.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.560
Those are of the Minatogawa school.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.640
They were all arranged by me.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.270
This is Sadamatsu Minatogawa,

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.520
president and representative
of the flower arrangement club.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.400
Nice to meet you!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.900
The flower arrangement club
is also a regular in the top ten,

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.820
but they have fewer and fewer members each year.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:52.070
That's why this is now basically
a clubroom just for Minatogawa, ryui.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:57.580
Minatogawa's power, Selfish Flower,
allows him to manipulate flowers, ryui.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.580
Do you like flowers?

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:00.750
If they're delicious!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.710
You can't eat flowers, ryui.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:06.210
Huh? But the yellow ones that
come with sashimi taste good.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.880
You can eat that, ryui?!

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.670
- I thought it was just for decoration, ryui!
- I wish you wouldn't eat the flowers.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.430
- It's delicious!
- I wish you wouldn't eat the flowers.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.300
I mean, look—

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.270
Right?

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.690
That covers one meal for today!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.150
Eruna, you forgot what you were trying to do, ryui.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.160
Oh, yeah!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:34.780
Excuse me!

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.330
The last great new student,
Eruna Ichinomiya, is here!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:44.540
The drama club is a popular club that ranks
high in both members and points, ryui.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.290
I won't lose in acting!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:50.970
I mean, I've been entrusted with the
important role of Tree since kindergarten!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.130
I'm an extraordinary actress!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:57.140
Oh, it's the cute teacher!

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.520
S-Stop it, ryui! I can't breathe, ryui!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:00.930
Her chest is huge!

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:04.440
What was that again?
The last <i>late</i> new student?

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.650
Not <i>late</i>, the last <i>great</i>!

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:08.530
What? The last <i>plate</i>?

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:09.730
No, that's not it!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.570
Then, the last <i>bait</i>?

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.570
Was that the last act?
Is she doing this on purpose?

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.410
You're too persistent! I said <i>great</i>!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.370
What's going on? It's so noisy...

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:22.160
Oh, I saw that person at the
new student welcome party.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.880
I'm the drama club representative,
Yuto Akama. Nice to meet you!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.460
Nice to meet you, too!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.840
Eruna is learning about different
special attacks for the club battles

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.170
by going around to different clubs, ryui.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:35.680
Oh, really?

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:38.100
Then, did you go to the astronomy club already?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:38.720
Not yet, ryui.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.930
Is the astronomy club amazing, too?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.520
No, not really.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.530
This is my attack...

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.360
...Coup d'Etat Faker!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.280
I'll play tricks on your eyes.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.660
Even though you're in the going-home club,
you haven't gone home yet?

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.750
No, I only just arrived at school.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:09.380
Eruna Ichinomiya, was it?

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:11.630
You seem concerned about her.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.190
Everyone's amazing...

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:32.400
What must I do to be able to use that power, too?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:34.240
There's no use rushing, ryui.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:39.450
Train your mind and body every day,
and with that hard work, one day...

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:47.710
Wow... There are so many stars!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.790
Hey, are you listening, ryui?!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.050
Oh, you're from yesterday...

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:56.420
Eruna Ichinomiya, right?

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.550
I can't believe Seisa invited you to join her club!

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:05.270
Speaking of which, the astronomy club
is scheduled for club activities here tonight, ryui.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:09.100
Isn't the astronomy club the one
Akama said wasn't that good earlier?

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:14.190
N-No, the astronomy club <i>is</i> good.
It's one of the top-ranking clubs, ryui!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.440
Where are the other
astronomy club members, ryui?

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:18.450
The upperclassmen aren't here yet.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:22.120
This is my first astronomical observation
since entering high school,

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:24.490
so I'm so happy...

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:29.120
I couldn't wait and came early,
but it looks like I'm the only one.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.540
What is this? Is he really a boy?!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:35.130
He's overflowing with girlish
behavior and femininity, though!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:39.470
Even though Asuhi is a new student, he's
already the astronomy club representative, ryui.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.350
He's very gifted, despite his youth.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:46.350
Oh no, I still have a lot to learn.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.560
Hey, can I take a peek at that, too?

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.810
Oh, yes. Please wait a moment.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.440
I'll adjust it so you can see more easily, Eruna.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.780
What a nice kid...

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.570
Okay, here you go!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.780
Thanks!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.540
Isn't it lovely?

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:09.330
Stars show us different
expressions depending on the day.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.500
I never get bored, even if
I look at them every day.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:16.250
Yeah... I feel like I could look at them forever.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.630
Oh, don't push that button...!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.810
Oh, I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.100
That just now was called Shooting Star.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:36.730
It's my power that fires when the telescope
is loaded with power from the stars.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:40.900
Its weakness is that anyone can
fire it once the bullets are loaded...

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.360
That's amazing, Asuhi!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.950
How did you learn to use this power?

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:48.870
Huh? I... don't know...

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.370
I just like looking at stars,

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:56.380
so I've been looking at them every day
since I was in elementary school.

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:59.590
And then, before I knew it...

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:04.760
I've got it! The keyword is "before I knew it"!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.220
Good things come to those who wait.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:07.810
Are you going to wait in that sleeping bag, ryui?

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.310
I don't want that!

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:13.140
Then you need to start by working hard
to get out of that sleeping bag, ryui.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:14.150
By the way...

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.060
Hm?

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:19.900
In the end, she wouldn't show it to me,
but what kind of power does Seisa have?

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.700
Seisa's power is called Killing Art, ryui.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:28.700
It's the only power at Mikagura Academy
that can be activated without an item.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.700
And the most amazing thing about that power is—

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.250
That's my goddess!

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:33.790
I take back the "good things
come to those who wait"!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.670
I'm going to do intensive training
and learn a special attack, too!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.420
Then, I'll let you practice
your special attack on me!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:46.640
Oh, I'll be Eruna's first partner!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:51.060
Gross. But because of that,
I can beat him up without holding back.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.600
What about your item, ryui?

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.350
Since I'm in the going-home club,
I guess I'll use this for now?

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.270
Try it, ryui!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:57.730
Come to me, Eruna!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.280
School Bag Crash!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:06.950
You're just hitting him with your bag, ryui.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.530
Then, I'll use this!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:09.620
Come to me, Eruna!

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:12.120
Sleeping Beauty!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.960
So you're just hitting him, ryui?

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:17.080
Then what about this?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.630
Come to me, Eruna!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:21.710
Lovely Event!

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:44.940
Yay! I did it, Bimii! It's our first
night alone in the nurse's office!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.860
What are you doing, ryui?!

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:57.960
In my delusions, I can activate techniques like
"this," "that," and "What?! Even that?!" but...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.710
Seisa!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:04.260
I suppose it's impossible for you after all.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.260
Th-That's not true!

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:09.300
But you can't fight in that state, can you?

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.350
It's fine! I'll definitely show you that I can win!

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:14.850
Because I want to win and become
an official going-home club member

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.940
and do club activities with you!

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:21.520
The going-home club just goes home.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:26.650
Even if I allowed you to join,
there's nothing for us to do together.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.610
We can go home together!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:33.870
I have a fluffy bed in a mansion.
You are in the dorm with a sleeping bag.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.240
We cannot go home together.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:40.460
Then we can go partway! We can stop
somewhere on the way! Take the long way!

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:44.000
We can stop by a delicious ice cream
shop and eat ice cream together

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.710
and get stomachaches and go
to the nurse's office together

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.630
and put bandages on
each other in the nurse's office...

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.850
We can do anything on the way home!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:57.310
I wanted to come to this school

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.730
because I saw you in the pamphlet,
and it was love at first sight!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:05.400
I wanted to go to the same
school as such a lovely person!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:11.160
Then, when you invited me to join
the going-home club, I was really happy!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.830
So what?

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.080
So...

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.540
I'll work hard with everything I have!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.300
Now, we will begin the match, ryui!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.920
Wait, I'm fighting against Himi?

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.640
It's amazing that you're the
going-home club representative, Eruna!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:39.600
But I'm more amazing 'cause I'm going to beat you!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.520
I won't lose, either!

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.730
The time limit is one hour.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.230
Whoever gets all three crystals broken first loses, ryui.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.610
No one's going to watch our fight?

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:54.700
The other students can watch
from wherever they like, ryui.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:59.700
The match is broadcast from
cameras installed around the school.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.840
Now, are you ready, ryui?

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:11.920
Begin the match.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.140
I won't let you escape!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.360
If I ambush her here...

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:31.900
Oof.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:40.830
Eruna, come out. It's time to eat!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:46.080
Hey, there are girls in swimsuits
wandering around the school!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:52.510
This is your big chance, Eruna!

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:56.050
Do people think I'm an idiot?

00:17:56.260 --> 00:18:01.060
You don't need to run away so quickly.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:03.350
I'll get the first one when I jump down,

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.520
get the second before she turns around,

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:10.190
and then get the third as she aims for my crystal.

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:18.990
I was waiting for you!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.830
She guessed what I was going to do?!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.250
Of course!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.710
I wouldn't be me if I were
tricked by something like that.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:32.880
Wait, wait, wait!

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.030
This is...

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.590
What's with this room?

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.130
Whoa...

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:33.320
You are a descendant of the chosen line.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.070
Now, awaken.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:42.370
You already had it inside you.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:52.420
Huh? I thought I just saw someone...

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:53.750
Who was it again...?

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.590
Found you!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.420
You're not allowed to come in here.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.470
Wait, hang on a sec!

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:03.760
No can do. I'm going to finish
this quickly and eat some snacks!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.860
What's going on all of a sudden?

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:16.400
Has she awakened? Now?

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:17.780
This is...

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:19.240
My body feels light!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.200
Lovely Ink!

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:28.290
Pawn!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.340
Is this me? I can move this fast?

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.920
Why?

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.640
Japanese chess?!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.570
So this is a club battle...?

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:59.070
It's so exciting!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.160
Check.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.040
But why Japanese chess?!

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:23.680
Now, awaken.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.930
You already had it inside you.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.890
I see, so this is my power.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:35.060
Tension max! Go!

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:48.080
I can't believe it...

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:51.580
How did she do it without an item...?

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.460
Did I win...?

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:57.170
Don't tell me I caused a huge upset?

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:02.460
You've finally awakened, Eruna?

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:42.860
Eruna, congratulations on your first victory!

00:23:43.070 --> 00:23:44.940
Eruna Ichinomiya's power has finally awakened.

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:46.280
Its name is Toy Gun!

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:49.240
But wait, a new assassin appears before her.

00:23:49.450 --> 00:23:50.700
Her name is Modded Himi!

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:52.530
No assassin like that shows up, ryui!

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.990
Oh, she will! If I keep believing,
someday she's sure to!

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.870
Even if she doesn't,
everybody has Modded Himi in his or her heart!

00:23:58.080 --> 00:23:59.120
I see her!

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:00.170
You can see her, ryui?!

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:02.290
For a Modded Himi, start by fastening

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.630
a freshly caught Himi's
arms and legs to the operating table.

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:07.970
Then rub into her face seaweed and kelp,

00:24:08.170 --> 00:24:10.930
which are full of nutrients
like minerals and arginine.

00:24:11.140 --> 00:24:13.260
And while you're making
her skin smooth and silky—

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:18.930
Yes! That's great, Eruna! Mod me that way too!

00:24:19.140 --> 00:24:20.640
Next time, "Not Quite a Heroine"!

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:22.940
You won't be seeing Modded Himi, ryui!
